    jit_const_size_u8_repeat_literal_blowup_2026-11-27, 0, "Seed JIT: a [0u8; 16777216] repeat literal with a compile-time constant size did not finish within 600 s and reached 16 GB RSS. The same literal with a runtime-valued size (val n) allocates 1-4 MB in 0.02 s."

